{"seq":1,"slug":"behavior-trees","title":"行为树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/behavior-patterns/behavior-trees","wordCount":929,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"行为树\">行为树</h1><p>行为树（Behavior Tree，BT）是 2005 年前后从游戏 AI 研究中诞生的行为决策框架，在 Halo 2 的 NPC AI 中大放异彩后迅速成为游戏 AI 的主流技术。相比 FSM，行为树更易于设计师理解和编辑，能够优雅地表达复杂的顺序逻辑和选择逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>行为树是一棵有根的有向树，根节点每帧被「tick」一次，tick 信号从根向叶子传播，每个节点返回三种状态之一：<strong>Success（成功）、Failure（失败）、Running（运行中）</strong>。树的结构决定了行为逻辑，而不是 FSM 中的转换条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四类节点\">四类节点</h2><p>行为树的所有节点只有四类，组合这四类可以表达任意复杂的行为逻辑。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Root] --&gt; B[Selector 选择节点]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Sequence 序列节点]&#10;    B --&gt; D[AttackSequence 序列节点]&#10;    C --&gt; E[IsPlayerInSight? 条件]&#10;    C --&gt; F[MoveToPlayer 行为]&#10;    D --&gt; G[IsInAttackRange? 条件]&#10;    D --&gt; H[AttackPlayer 行为]\">graph TD\n    A[Root] --&gt; B[Selector 选择节点]\n    B --&gt; C[Sequence 序列节点]\n    B --&gt; D[AttackSequence 序列节点]\n    C --&gt; E[IsPlayerInSight? 条件]\n    C --&gt; F[MoveToPlayer 行为]\n    D --&gt; G[IsInAttackRange? 条件]\n    D --&gt; H[AttackPlayer 行为]</pre><h3 id=\"叶节点-leaf-node\">叶节点（Leaf Node）</h3><p>叶节点是实际执行操作的最小单元，分为两种：</p>\n<p><strong>条件节点（Condition）</strong>：检查某个条件是否为真，立即返回 Success 或 Failure，不执行任何行动。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class IsPlayerInSight : BTLeafNode&#10;{&#10;    private float sightRange;&#10;    private float sightAngle;&#10;&#10;    public override NodeState Tick(BTBlackboard blackboard)&#10;    {&#10;        var player = blackboard.Get&lt;Transform&gt;(&quot;PlayerTransform&quot;);&#10;        var enemy = blackboard.Get&lt;Transform&gt;(&quot;EnemyTransform&quot;);&#10;&#10;        if (player == null) return NodeState.Failure;&#10;&#10;        float dist = Vector3.Distance(enemy.position, player.position);&#10;        if (dist &gt; sightRange) return NodeState.Failure;&#10;&#10;        Vector3 dirToPlayer = (player.position - enemy.position).normalized;&#10;        float angle = Vector3.Angle(enemy.forward, dirToPlayer);&#10;        if (angle &gt; sightAngle * 0.5f) return NodeState.Failure;&#10;&#10;        // 视线遮挡检测&#10;        if (Physics.Raycast(enemy.position + Vector3.up,&#10;            dirToPlayer, dist, LayerMask.GetMask(&quot;Obstacle&quot;)))&#10;            return NodeState.Failure;&#10;&#10;        blackboard.Set(&quot;LastKnownPlayerPos&quot;, player.position);&#10;        return NodeState.Success;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class IsPlayerInSight : BTLeafNode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float sightRange;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float sightAngle;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override NodeState Tick(BTBlackboard blackboard)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var player = blackboard.Get&#x3C;Transform>(\"PlayerTransform\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var enemy = blackboard.Get&#x3C;Transform>(\"EnemyTransform\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (player == null) return NodeState.Failure;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float dist = Vector3.Distance(enemy.position, player.position);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (dist > sightRange) return NodeState.Failure;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Vector3 dirToPlayer = (player.position - enemy.position).normalized;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float angle = Vector3.Angle(enemy.forward, dirToPlayer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (angle > sightAngle * 0.5f) return NodeState.Failure;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 视线遮挡检测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (Physics.Raycast(enemy.position + Vector3.up,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dirToPlayer, dist, LayerMask.GetMask(\"Obstacle\")))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return NodeState.Failure;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        blackboard.Set(\"LastKnownPlayerPos\", player.position);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return NodeState.Success;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>行为节点（Action）</strong>：执行一个具体操作，可能跨越多帧，返回 Running 直到完成。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class MoveToTarget : BTLeafNode&#10;{&#10;    private NavMeshAgent agent;&#10;&#10;    public override NodeState OnEnter(BTBlackboard blackboard)&#10;    {&#10;        agent = blackboard.Get&lt;NavMeshAgent&gt;(&quot;NavAgent&quot;);&#10;        var target = blackboard.Get&lt;Vector3&gt;(&quot;LastKnownPlayerPos&quot;);&#10;        agent.SetDestination(target);&#10;        return NodeState.Running;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override NodeState Tick(BTBlackboard blackboard)&#10;    {&#10;        if (agent.pathPending) return NodeState.Running;&#10;&#10;        if (agent.remainingDistance &lt;= agent.stoppingDistance)&#10;        {&#10;            return NodeState.Success;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        if (!agent.hasPath || agent.pathStatus == NavMeshPathStatus.PathInvalid)&#10;            return NodeState.Failure;&#10;&#10;        return NodeState.Running;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public override void OnExit(BTBlackboard blackboard)&#10;    {&#10;        agent.ResetPath();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class MoveToTarget : BTLeafNode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private NavMeshAgent agent;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override NodeState OnEnter(BTBlackboard blackboard)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        agent = blackboard.Get&#x3C;NavMeshAgent>(\"NavAgent\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var target = blackboard.Get&#x3C;Vector3>(\"LastKnownPlayerPos\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        agent.SetDestination(target);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return NodeState.Running;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override NodeState Tick(BTBlackboard blackboard)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (agent.pathPending) return NodeState.Running;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (agent.remainingDistance &#x3C;= agent.stoppingDistance)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return NodeState.Success;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (!agent.hasPath || agent.pathStatus == NavMeshPathStatus.PathInvalid)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return NodeState.Failure;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return NodeState.Running;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override void OnExit(BTBlackboard blackboard)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        agent.ResetPath();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"序列节点-sequence\">序列节点（Sequence）</h3><p>序列节点像逻辑 AND：<strong>从左到右依次 tick 子节点，遇到 Failure 立即返回 Failure，全部 Success 才返回 Success</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class SequenceNode : BTCompositeNode&#10;{&#10;    private int currentChildIndex = 0;&#10;&#10;    public override NodeState Tick(BTBlackboard blackboard)&#10;    {&#10;        while (currentChildIndex &lt; Children.Count)&#10;        {&#10;            var result = Children[currentChildIndex].Tick(blackboard);&#10;&#10;            switch (result)&#10;            {&#10;                case NodeState.Success:&#10;                    currentChildIndex++;&#10;                    break;&#10;                case NodeState.Failure:&#10;                    currentChildIndex = 0; // 重置，下次从头开始&#10;                    return NodeState.Failure;&#10;                case NodeState.Running:&#10;                    return NodeState.Running; // 持有执行权&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        currentChildIndex = 0;&#10;        return NodeState.Success;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class SequenceNode : BTCompositeNode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int currentChildIndex = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override NodeState Tick(BTBlackboard blackboard)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while (currentChildIndex &#x3C; Children.Count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            var result = Children[currentChildIndex].Tick(blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            switch (result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                case NodeState.Success:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    currentChildIndex++;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                case NodeState.Failure:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    currentChildIndex = 0; // 重置，下次从头开始</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    return NodeState.Failure;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                case NodeState.Running:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    return NodeState.Running; // 持有执行权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentChildIndex = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return NodeState.Success;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>序列节点表达「先做 A，成功后再做 B，再成功后做 C」的流程，例如：条件→导航→攻击。</p>\n<h3 id=\"选择节点-selector\">选择节点（Selector）</h3><p>选择节点像逻辑 OR：<strong>从左到右依次 tick 子节点，遇到 Success 立即返回 Success，全部 Failure 才返回 Failure</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class SelectorNode : BTCompositeNode&#10;{&#10;    private int currentChildIndex = 0;&#10;&#10;    public override NodeState Tick(BTBlackboard blackboard)&#10;    {&#10;        while (currentChildIndex &lt; Children.Count)&#10;        {&#10;            var result = Children[currentChildIndex].Tick(blackboard);&#10;&#10;            switch (result)&#10;            {&#10;                case NodeState.Failure:&#10;                    currentChildIndex++;&#10;                    break;&#10;                case NodeState.Success:&#10;                    currentChildIndex = 0;&#10;                    return NodeState.Success;&#10;                case NodeState.Running:&#10;                    return NodeState.Running;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        currentChildIndex = 0;&#10;        return NodeState.Failure;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class SelectorNode : BTCompositeNode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int currentChildIndex = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override NodeState Tick(BTBlackboard blackboard)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while (currentChildIndex &#x3C; Children.Count)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            var result = Children[currentChildIndex].Tick(blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            switch (result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                case NodeState.Failure:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    currentChildIndex++;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    break;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                case NodeState.Success:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    currentChildIndex = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    return NodeState.Success;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                case NodeState.Running:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    return NodeState.Running;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        currentChildIndex = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return NodeState.Failure;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>选择节点表达「优先尝试 A，失败则尝试 B，再失败则尝试 C」的回退逻辑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"装饰节点-decorator\">装饰节点（Decorator）</h3><p>装饰节点只有一个子节点，包裹子节点修改其返回值或控制执行方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>装饰节点类型</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Inverter（取反）</td>\n<td>将子节点的 Success/Failure 互换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Repeater（重复）</td>\n<td>重复执行子节点 N 次或无限次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RetryUntilSuccess</td>\n<td>子节点 Failure 时重试，直到 Success</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cooldown</td>\n<td>在冷却时间内直接返回 Failure</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TimeLimit</td>\n<td>超过时间限制时返回 Failure</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class InverterDecorator : BTDecoratorNode&#10;{&#10;    public override NodeState Tick(BTBlackboard blackboard)&#10;    {&#10;        var result = Child.Tick(blackboard);&#10;        return result switch&#10;        {&#10;            NodeState.Success =&gt; NodeState.Failure,&#10;            NodeState.Failure =&gt; NodeState.Success,&#10;            _ =&gt; NodeState.Running&#10;        };&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class CooldownDecorator : BTDecoratorNode&#10;{&#10;    private float cooldownTime;&#10;    private float lastSuccessTime = float.MinValue;&#10;&#10;    public override NodeState Tick(BTBlackboard blackboard)&#10;    {&#10;        if (Time.time - lastSuccessTime &lt; cooldownTime)&#10;            return NodeState.Failure;&#10;&#10;        var result = Child.Tick(blackboard);&#10;        if (result == NodeState.Success)&#10;            lastSuccessTime = Time.time;&#10;&#10;        return result;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class InverterDecorator : BTDecoratorNode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override NodeState Tick(BTBlackboard blackboard)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var result = Child.Tick(blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return result switch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            NodeState.Success => NodeState.Failure,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            NodeState.Failure => NodeState.Success,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _ => NodeState.Running</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class CooldownDecorator : BTDecoratorNode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float cooldownTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private float lastSuccessTime = float.MinValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override NodeState Tick(BTBlackboard blackboard)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (Time.time - lastSuccessTime &#x3C; cooldownTime)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return NodeState.Failure;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var result = Child.Tick(blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (result == NodeState.Success)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            lastSuccessTime = Time.time;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"黑板通信\">黑板通信</h2><p>黑板（Blackboard）是行为树中各节点之间共享数据的通用存储，相当于节点的「共享内存」。所有节点通过黑板读写数据，而不是直接持有对象引用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class BTBlackboard&#10;{&#10;    private Dictionary&lt;string, object&gt; data = new Dictionary&lt;string, object&gt;();&#10;&#10;    public void Set&lt;T&gt;(string key, T value)&#10;        =&gt; data[key] = value;&#10;&#10;    public T Get&lt;T&gt;(string key, T defaultValue = default)&#10;    {&#10;        if (data.TryGetValue(key, out var value) &amp;&amp; value is T typedValue)&#10;            return typedValue;&#10;        return defaultValue;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public bool Has(string key) =&gt; data.ContainsKey(key);&#10;&#10;    public void Remove(string key) =&gt; data.Remove(key);&#10;&#10;    // 调试支持&#10;    public IReadOnlyDictionary&lt;string, object&gt; GetAll() =&gt; data;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class BTBlackboard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Dictionary&#x3C;string, object> data = new Dictionary&#x3C;string, object>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Set&#x3C;T>(string key, T value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        => data[key] = value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public T Get&#x3C;T>(string key, T defaultValue = default)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (data.TryGetValue(key, out var value) &#x26;&#x26; value is T typedValue)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return typedValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return defaultValue;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public bool Has(string key) => data.ContainsKey(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void Remove(string key) => data.Remove(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 调试支持</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public IReadOnlyDictionary&#x3C;string, object> GetAll() => data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>黑板的好处是节点解耦——<code>IsPlayerInSight</code> 节点将玩家位置写入黑板，<code>MoveToTarget</code> 节点从黑板读取，两者不直接依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tick-执行模型\">tick 执行模型</h2><p>行为树有两种 tick 策略：</p>\n<p><strong>每帧 tick（连续 tick）</strong>：每帧从根节点重新开始，条件可以随时打断正在运行的行为。适合需要响应性高的 AI。</p>\n<p><strong>事件驱动 tick</strong>：只在有事件发生（感知、定时器、行动完成）时 tick 一次。性能更好，适合大量 NPC。</p>\n<p>连续 tick 带来一个重要问题：如何处理正在 Running 的节点被更高优先级的子树打断？这就是**抢占（Preemption）**机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 支持抢占的序列节点&#10;public class ReactiveSelectorNode : BTCompositeNode&#10;{&#10;    public override NodeState Tick(BTBlackboard blackboard)&#10;    {&#10;        for (int i = 0; i &lt; Children.Count; i++)&#10;        {&#10;            var result = Children[i].Tick(blackboard);&#10;&#10;            if (result != NodeState.Failure)&#10;            {&#10;                // 如果不是当前运行的子节点，打断之前的&#10;                if (i != currentRunningIndex)&#10;                {&#10;                    Children[currentRunningIndex]?.Abort();&#10;                    currentRunningIndex = i;&#10;                }&#10;                return result;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        return NodeState.Failure;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 支持抢占的序列节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class ReactiveSelectorNode : BTCompositeNode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public override NodeState Tick(BTBlackboard blackboard)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (int i = 0; i &#x3C; Children.Count; i++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            var result = Children[i].Tick(blackboard);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if (result != NodeState.Failure)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                // 如果不是当前运行的子节点，打断之前的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (i != currentRunningIndex)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    Children[currentRunningIndex]?.Abort();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    currentRunningIndex = i;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return NodeState.Failure;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"实战构建示例\">实战构建示例</h2><p>完整的巡逻 NPC 行为树：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Root&#10;└── Selector（优先级从高到低）&#10;    ├── Sequence（战斗）&#10;    │   ├── IsPlayerInSight?&#10;    │   ├── Selector（攻击或追击）&#10;    │   │   ├── Sequence（近战攻击）&#10;    │   │   │   ├── IsInMeleeRange?&#10;    │   │   │   └── MeleeAttack（冷却 1s）&#10;    │   │   └── Sequence（射击）&#10;    │   │       ├── IsInShootRange?&#10;    │   │       └── ShootAtPlayer&#10;    │   └── MoveToPlayer（追击兜底）&#10;    ├── Sequence（警戒）&#10;    │   ├── HasLastKnownPlayerPos?&#10;    │   ├── MoveToLastKnownPos&#10;    │   └── LookAround（3 秒）&#10;    └── PatrolAlongPath（默认巡逻）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Root</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Selector（优先级从高到低）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── Sequence（战斗）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── IsPlayerInSight?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── Selector（攻击或追击）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   │   ├── Sequence（近战攻击）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   │   │   ├── IsInMeleeRange?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   │   │   └── MeleeAttack（冷却 1s）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   │   └── Sequence（射击）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   │       ├── IsInShootRange?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   │       └── ShootAtPlayer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── MoveToPlayer（追击兜底）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── Sequence（警戒）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── HasLastKnownPlayerPos?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── MoveToLastKnownPos</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── LookAround（3 秒）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── PatrolAlongPath（默认巡逻）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>行为树用四类节点（叶/序列/选择/装饰）组合出任意复杂的行为逻辑，tick 执行模型让条件可以随时影响当前行为，黑板机制解耦了节点间的数据依赖。行为树的核心优势是可视化调试和设计师友好性，代价是大型行为树的维护成本和调试复杂度。</p>\n<p><strong>同章节其他内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"goap-planning\">目标导向行动规划</a> — 自动搜索行动序列，无需手动连线的 AI 决策</li>\n<li><a href=\"utility-ai\">效用系统</a> — 基于评分权衡的「拟人化」行为决策方案</li>\n<li><a href=\"../fundamentals/fsm-design-patterns\">有限状态机设计模式</a> — 行为树常与 FSM 结合，FSM 控制顶层状态，BT 处理状态内的复杂行为</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"行为树","id":"行为树"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四类节点","id":"四类节点"},{"level":3,"text":"叶节点（Leaf Node）","id":"叶节点-leaf-node"},{"level":3,"text":"序列节点（Sequence）","id":"序列节点-sequence"},{"level":3,"text":"选择节点（Selector）","id":"选择节点-selector"},{"level":3,"text":"装饰节点（Decorator）","id":"装饰节点-decorator"},{"level":2,"text":"黑板通信","id":"黑板通信"},{"level":2,"text":"tick 执行模型","id":"tick-执行模型"},{"level":2,"text":"实战构建示例","id":"实战构建示例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"状态机实现策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/fundamentals/state-machine-implementation"},"next":{"title":"目标导向行动规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/behavior-patterns/goap-planning"}}